{"id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-PA.md","title":"Peano Arithmetic with Parameters","display":"df-PA — Peano Arithmetic with Parameters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-PA","aliases":["67-df-PA"],"display":"df-PA — Peano Arithmetic with Parameters","depends_on":["[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-sentence]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"induction scheme","source_printed_pages":7,"source_pdf_pages":18,"source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-PA"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-PA</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-PA — Peano Arithmetic with Parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"induction scheme"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"7"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"18"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}\">\\(L_A=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}\\)</span> 是算术语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为 Robinson 算术，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"824fdc45d800b7dd\" href=\"?note=824fdc45d800b7dd\" title=\"67-df-robinson-arithmetic\">67-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是公式集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为指定变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\">\\(\\vec y\\)</span> 列出公式除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 外的全部自由变量；允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不自由出现。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(t,\\vec y)\">\\(\\alpha(t,\\vec y)\\)</span> 表示避免捕获的项代入，所有 displayed universal closures 均是句法构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}\">\\(\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 分别为下式引入的归纳实例构造与公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\)</span> 为变量集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a> 引用的自由变量函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\vec y\\bigl[(\\alpha(0,\\vec y)\\land\\forall x(\\alpha(x,\\vec y)\\to\\alpha(Sx,\\vec y)))\\to\\forall x\\alpha(x,\\vec y)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}(\\alpha):\n\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A},\\ \\vec y\\in(\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\setminus\\{x\\})^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\{y_i:i&lt;|\\vec y|\\}\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\vec y|\\ (y_i\\ne y_j)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\vec y\\bigl[(\\alpha(0,\\vec y)\\land\\forall x(\\alpha(x,\\vec y)\\to\\alpha(Sx,\\vec y)))\\to\\forall x\\alpha(x,\\vec y)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}(\\alpha):\n\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A},\\ \\vec y\\in(\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\setminus\\{x\\})^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\{y_i:i&lt;|\\vec y|\\}\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\vec y|\\ (y_i\\ne y_j)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 p.7 明确允许归纳公式含额外自由参数，并取全称闭包。旧条目只在 Remark 提到参数闭包，使 Assertion 未必给出句子集合；现已在构造式中补全。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"824fdc45d800b7dd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_A=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}$ 是算术语言；$Q$ 为 Robinson 算术，见 [[67-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}$ 和 $\\mathrm{PA}$ 分别为下式引入的归纳实例构造与公理集；$\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}$ 为变量集合，$\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}$ 取 [[67-df-sentence]] 引用的自由变量函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L_A=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha(t,\\vec y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndAx}_{x,\\vec y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\math